    <button id="suspended-body">"suspended-body"</button>
    <ol>
      <li>"unmapped while pending (pending): Err MapFailed MapAborted, then unmapped"</li>
      <li>"destroyed while pending: Err MapFailed MapAborted"</li>
      <li>"map after destroy: Err InvalidInput ResourceDestroyed buffer"</li>
      <li>"lost while pending: Err DeviceLost UnknownLoss observed 0"</li>
      <li>"a second map while pending: Err InvalidInput MappingState buffer pending"</li>
      <li>"the first: Ok mapping, then mapped"</li>
      <li>"cancelled while pending, then unmapped"</li>
      <li>"map again: Ok mapping, then mapped"</li>
      <li>"the first range after a remap: Err ResourceExpired range"</li>
      <li>"a range of the first mapping: Err InvalidInput ResourceExpired mapping"</li>
      <li>"current mapping: the second"</li>
      <li>"second mapping live after destroy: no"</li>
      <li>"a range of it after destroy: Err InvalidInput ResourceExpired mapping"</li>
    </ol>
  </main>
</body>
